{
  "format": "ziffr.pack/2",
  "id": "ziffr/agency",
  "name": "Agency or freelancer",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "summary": "Billable hours, utilisation, revenue, the effective hourly rate, open invoices and pipeline, with a monthly dashboard and a Workflow that asks for hours on Fridays.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziffr"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "ziffr": ">=0.20",
  "audience": {
    "industries": [
      "agency",
      "professional_services"
    ],
    "employeeBands": [
      "1-10",
      "11-50"
    ]
  },
  "listing": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/ziffr/ziffr/tree/main/packs"
  },
  "guide": {
    "whatItsFor": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "For an agency or a freelancer who wants to see the hours that can be billed, what they earn, and the money still to come."
      }
    ],
    "beforeYouStart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "The week's billable hours, and for the month: all hours worked, the revenue, the hours on client projects, open invoices and the value of open deals.",
          "Free room for the Metrics in your Workspace's size: the Set up form says how many it makes and how many fit."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "firstSteps": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Start here"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "numbered": true,
        "items": [
          "Open **Settings**, then **Packs**. Under this Pack, choose **Set up from this Pack**.",
          "Keep the Metrics you want ticked, up to all 6, with the dashboard **Agency monthly** and the Workflow **Friday hours**. Tick **Ask me for their values** if you send the figures yourself, then choose **Set up**.",
          "If someone else sends figures, do this right after Set up: open the **Setup Guide** from **Help**, choose **Team**, and under **Who is asked for what** pick the person for each Metric and press **Ask**. It lists your ten newest Metrics.",
          "Send the first figures: answer the request Ziffr sends, or open a Metric you submit and choose **Record a value**.",
          "Open **Dashboards** and then **Agency monthly**. It fills as values come in."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "eachPart": [
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "**Billable hours** by week, and **Billable utilisation**: billed hours as a share of all hours worked.",
          "**Revenue** invoiced in the month, and the **Effective hourly rate**: revenue divided by the hours worked on client projects.",
          "**Open invoices** and **Pipeline value** at month end.",
          "The dashboard **Agency monthly** shows them together.",
          "The Workflow **Friday hours** asks for the week's hours on Friday, due on Monday. A figure that is still missing after its Due Date is raised with the Metric's owner."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Is anything worked out for me?"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "No. You send all six figures, the utilisation and the hourly rate too."
      }
    ]
  },
  "contents": {
    "metrics": [
      {
        "key": "billable-hours",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Billable hours",
          "description": "Hours worked on client projects that can be invoiced, in the week; internal work and sales are not counted.",
          "category": "People",
          "industries": [
            "agency"
          ],
          "period": "week",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "hours",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "number",
          "decimals": 1,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "utilisation",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Billable utilisation",
          "description": "Hours billed to clients as a share of all hours worked in the month.",
          "category": "People",
          "industries": [
            "agency"
          ],
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "none",
          "polarity": "target",
          "unit": "%",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "percent",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "targetMin": 70,
          "targetMax": 85,
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "revenue",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Revenue",
          "description": "Net revenue invoiced in the month, excluding VAT, discounts and credit notes.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "sum",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "hourly-rate",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Effective hourly rate",
          "description": "Revenue of the month divided by the hours worked on client projects in it, billed or not.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "industries": [
            "agency"
          ],
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "none",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 2,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "open-invoices",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Open invoices",
          "description": "Invoiced amounts clients have not paid yet, at month end.",
          "category": "Finance",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "lower",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "pipeline",
        "comesFrom": { "by": "person" },
        "metric": {
          "format": "ziffr.metric/1",
          "name": "Pipeline value",
          "description": "Value of all open deals at month end, not weighted by probability.",
          "category": "Sales",
          "period": "month",
          "aggregation": "last",
          "polarity": "higher",
          "unit": "€",
          "unitPosition": "after",
          "valueFormat": "currency",
          "decimals": 0,
          "submissionRule": "overwrite",
          "sources": [
            "web_form",
            "mail",
            "slack",
            "telegram",
            "api"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "dashboards": [
      {
        "key": "agency-monthly",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.dashboard-template/1",
          "name": "Agency monthly",
          "description": "Hours, utilisation, revenue and the hourly rate it makes, and the money still to come.",
          "slots": [
            {
              "label": "Revenue",
              "suggests": "revenue"
            },
            {
              "label": "Billable utilisation",
              "suggests": "utilisation"
            },
            {
              "label": "Effective hourly rate",
              "suggests": "hourly-rate"
            },
            {
              "label": "Open invoices",
              "suggests": "open-invoices"
            },
            {
              "label": "Pipeline value",
              "suggests": "pipeline"
            },
            {
              "label": "Billable hours",
              "suggests": "billable-hours"
            }
          ],
          "widgets": [
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "gauge",
              "slots": [
                1
              ],
              "x": 3,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                2
              ],
              "x": 6,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                3
              ],
              "x": 9,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 3,
              "h": 4
            },
            {
              "view": "line",
              "slots": [
                0
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 8,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12,
                "showTarget": true
              }
            },
            {
              "view": "number",
              "slots": [
                4
              ],
              "x": 8,
              "y": 4,
              "w": 4,
              "h": 6
            },
            {
              "view": "bars",
              "slots": [
                5
              ],
              "x": 0,
              "y": 10,
              "w": 12,
              "h": 6,
              "settings": {
                "window": 12
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "workflows": [
      {
        "key": "friday-hours",
        "template": {
          "format": "ziffr.workflow-template/1",
          "name": "Friday hours",
          "description": "Each week's hours are asked for on Friday and due on Monday.",
          "dueWorkingDays": 1,
          "steps": [
            {
              "type": "remind",
              "daysBefore": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "escalate",
              "to": "owner",
              "daysAfter": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "publish",
              "lock": false
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
